          "parts": [
            "Tuesday night. No chaos. No overthinking. Just vibes.\n\nLast night was all about a **Nashville Predators hockey game** with Miranda, tucked into the swankiest seats in the whole stadium, soaking up downtown energy without rushing or proving anything to anyone.\n\nThe booze was flowing.  \nThe gourmet food showed up hot and indulgent.  \nAnd the sweet treats? Absolutely worth it.\n\nThere is something powerful about choosing chill on a random Tuesday. About letting go of the noise, the drama, the mental tabs we keep open, and just being present. Laughing. Watching the game. Enjoying great company. Letting life feel easy for a night.\n\nIt is a mindset shift.  \nYou get to decide what you give energy to.  \nYou get to choose calm.  \nYou get to enjoy the finer things without guilt or explanation.\n\nNo drama. No urgency. Just a night on the town, good food, great seats, and the reminder that life is meant to be enjoyed."
          ]
